          ],
          "script_extra": null,
          "note": "Khârazmî is surname of Abŭ Ja`far Mohammad ebn Musâ, the great mathematician of the ninth century. His great work \"Al-Jabr wal Moqâbeleh\" introduced the Arabic numerals and Algebra in Europe.",
